 "summary": "Same Noachide Laws slide as before, now listing the seven laws: do not deny God, do not blaspheme God, do not murder, do not engage in illicit sexual relations, do not steal, do not eat from a live animal, and establish courts/a legal system to ensure obedience. The word 'God' is shown in multi-coloured letters.",
